-- `src/decompose.rs`, `src/recompose.rs`, `src/replace.rs`,
-- `src/stream_safe.rs` and `src/quick_check.rs`.
--
-- The crate's are iterators; these take and give a whole vector of code
-- points, in the same order the iterators would give them.
